<a href=\"#/wiki/Ancient%20Crypt%20Rune\">Ancient Crypt Rune</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Necromantic%20Crypt%20Rune\"><img alt=\"Necromantic Crypt Rune\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Necromantic_Crypt_Rune_f2585a.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span> <a href=\"#/wiki/Necromantic%20Crypt%20Rune\">Necromantic Crypt Rune</a></li></ul>\n<p>Possible weapons are:\n</p>\n<ul><li><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Crypt%20Bile\"><img alt=\"Crypt Bile\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Crypt_Bile_826dd8.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span> <a href=\"#/wiki/Crypt%20Bile\">Crypt Bile</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Crypt%20Breaker\"><img alt=\"Crypt Breaker\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Crypt_Breaker_1eb68e.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span> <a href=\"#/wiki/Crypt%20Breaker\">Crypt Breaker</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Crypt%20Jaw\"><img alt=\"Crypt Jaw\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Crypt_Jaw_f16efb.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span> <a href=\"#/wiki/Crypt%20Jaw\">Crypt Jaw</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Crypt%20Slicer\"><img alt=\"Crypt Slicer\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Crypt_Slicer_feeeac.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span> <a href=\"#/wiki/Crypt%20Slicer\">Crypt Slicer</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a hr